### 1. Get or Create Cellphones Category
GET http://localhost:1337/api/categories?filters[Name][$eq]=Cellphones&populate=*
Authorization: Bearer {{STRAPI_API_TOKEN}}

### 2. Update Cellphones Category with AllowedSpecComponents
PUT http://localhost:1337/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "AllowedSpecComponents": [
      "property.phone-display",
      "property.phone-battery",
      "property.phone-performance"
    ]
  }
}

### 3. Create new Item with Cellphones Category
POST http://localhost:1337/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "Title": "Test iPhone Auto-Generate",
    "Category": 1,
    "ItemType": "Product"
  }
}

### 4. Get Item with PropertyList populated
GET http://localhost:1337/api/items/1?populate[PropertyList]=*&populate[Category][fields][0]=Name
